      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Definitely feels like something that should be included. There's a few people I know who are photosensitive who have to be extremely careful when world hopping and have safe space bubbles added to their avatar themselves, but most players don't have the skill needed to do that themselves and a default option would be great.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
