      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "As someone with photophobia (light sensitiviy) this would genuinely be amazing! When my light sensitiviy is particularly bad, I'll sometimes have to leave club worlds where my friends are if the club doesn't include a toggle for me to turn off the light effects. Having this would mean I wouldn't have to do that or get my friends to move instances with me.",
